// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1923804759" "I have put a lot of time and energy into managing assets and infiltrating the ranks of the various street gangs across Paragon City, and now I'm focusing my attention on The Hollows.  If you're going to work for me, you need to show me that you have what it takes.<br><br>So I'm going to have you run a little errand for me.  As a test.  If you do a good job, you'll have begun to earn my trust and we'll work together again.<br><br>Sound fair?  Good."
// AcceptString :
"P855541539" "Show Meg that you have what it takes"
// SendOffString :
"P1930110482" "Excellent, {HeroName}.  Look, this one is time sensitive, so you need to work fast.  Word on the street is that the <color red>Hellions</color> are doing some promotions within their ranks again.  <br><br>Your job is to take out their leader, a guy by the name of {Boss_Name_Hellions}, and throw them into chaos.  That'll slow them down for a little bit.  You have 30 minutes to take him out.  Good luck.<br><br><color orange>You have 30 minutes to complete this assignment</color>."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3865703041" "Defeat {Boss_Name_Hellions}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1488313892" "Time is crucial here, so you might want to get moving."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4178907059" "Looks like the party's already begun.  Time to get in there and break things up."

