// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3430875018" "You know, it really irritates me when the bad guys flaunt their illegal activities right in my back yard.  Something's going down right here in <color deepskyblue>Cherry Hills</color> and I want you to take care of it.  Another one of my sources just tipped me off to a new guy in the <color red>Hellions</color> organization who is trying to make a name for himself.  <br><br>His name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_Hellions}</color>, but I think he needs a new name.  Prisoner."
// AcceptString :
"P2035218843" "Accept assignment to defeat {Boss_Name_Hellions}"
// SendOffString :
"P2220402368" "Those little arsonists are punks.  Get rid of this {Boss_Name_Hellions} and, while you're at it, take out a few of his flunkies, too."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3253119357" "He's not getting any less motivated to take over while you stand in front of me, {HeroName}.  You wanted a job, you got it.  It's go time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3063197062" "It wasn't too hard to find this warehouse.  The strong smell of char is noticeable all the way down the block."

