"P2959591213" "It's bad enough when the <color red>Lost</color> make a nuisance of themselves in another city like Faultline, but when they come here to <color deepskyblue>Cherry Hills</color> then I start to have a real problem.  I have a name for you.  <color orange>{Boss_Name_Lost}</color>.  One of my sources just told me that he's causing some trouble.  <br><br>I need you to go in and take him out, and quick."
// AcceptString :
"P1929248266" "Accept assignment to defeat {Boss_Name_Lost}"
// SendOffString :
"P3501304057" "This guy is quite the public speaker, both on the streets and within the Lost ranks.  I need you to deal with him before this goes any further."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2947015908" "Defeat {Boss_Name_Lost}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P331455043" "Neutralize him and a few of his lackeys before he can scratch his way any further up the ranks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
