// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2200224313" "I always tend to underestimate the <color red>Trolls</color>.  Half the time I think they're dumb as dirt and then, every once in a while, they go and do something smart and sneaky.  I can't attribute this to the collective, so I think it's got to be one man.  A guy by the name of <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color>.  <br><br>One of my informants told me he's hanging out in an abandoned warehouse right here in <color deepskyblue>Cherry Hills</color>.  I'd appreciate it if you'd take care of him, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P2798300290" "Accept assignment to defeat {Boss_Name_Trolls}"
// SendOffString :
"P2040269394" "This guy is a real piece of work.  He's a Troll, but there's something about him.  He's as strong as an ox and I think he's been taking Superadine, but he's not like the other Trolls.  He's smart.  That's bad.  If he gains too much influence within the Trolls, he'll become a real thorn in our side.  That can't happen."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2606061248" "Defeat {Boss_Name_Trolls}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1380563822" "The Trolls are tough.  Can't have them organized, too.  Better take care of it now."

