// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3099409355" "<color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color>.  Sounds like the name of a ritzy hotel doesn't it?  Well, there is nothing glamorous about what is going on down there right now.  One of my sources just tipped me off to a <color red>Hellions</color> upstart by the name of <color orange>{Boss_Name_Hellions}</color> who is causing some trouble.  <br><br>I need you to go in and take him down.  As in yesterday."
// SendOffString :
"P163699533" "Time for a bit of spring cleaning, {HeroName}.  If anyone can take out this guy, and a few of his minions, I know it's you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4119825826" "You've got some work to do.  Now's not the time to be standing around."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4198695269" "What is it with those Hellions and arson?  These guys need to be stopped."

