// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1010444612" "You know, {HeroName}, it just never ends.  As usual, something's going down in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color> and I want you to take care of it.  I was just tipped off that some new Lost guy named <color orange>{Boss_Name_Lost}</color> in the <color red>Lost</color> is causing major trouble.  Think you can take care of it for me?"
// SendOffString :
"P1490926703" "It's bad enough what the Lost do to themselves.  But it looks like they're on a recruitment binge and their new leader is quite the public speaker, both on the streets and within the Lost ranks.  I need you to deal with him before this goes any further."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1250954494" "Guess this guy won't remain lost for long, now will he?"

