// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P398938711" "Well, if it's not one thing, it's another.  You know?  So there's some punk named <color orange>{Outcasts_Boss_Name}</color> within the <color red>Outcasts</color> who's causing a lot of trouble in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color>.  What do I want you to do?  Ground him."
// AcceptString :
"P1615120351" "Accept assignment to defeat {Outcasts_Boss_Name}"
// SendOffString :
"P643258996" "Go in, bust a few heads and send some of his flunkies packing, then take out this leader wannabe.  Think you can handle that?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4284730565" "Defeat {Outcasts_Boss_Name}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P67612036" "Get going, {HeroName}.  The longer you delay, the more power he gets.  And I don't mean electricity."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P788988740" "This office has been abandoned a long time.  Even the rats have left."

