// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Boss_Name_Skulls 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P929006624" "Well, the <color red>Skulls</color> are at it again.  Some upstart is trying to make a name for himself in <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color> and I want you to take care of it.  <br><br>This one doesn't strike me as brighter than any of the others who have come before him, but that's not a chance I'm willing to take.   His name's <color orange>{Boss_Name_Skulls}</color>.  Think you can handle him?"
// SendOffString :
"P3744930466" "It seems like every week there's some new guy trying to crawl his way to the top, on the backs of others, and putting the lives of the rest of us at risk.  Not this time.  Show him what's what and make sure his 'followers' get the hint, too."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1994372916" "If you're standing here, no one is there making this problem go away.  My faith in you wasn't misplaced was it, {HeroName}?"

