"P3522079809" "Blake"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2367610643" "Bob"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P583514478" "Krull"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P3604363710" "Curly"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P1706529592" "Dino"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P3809947607" "Jake"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P1945026892" "Prince"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2903507070" "I have a <color red>Troll</color> problem on my hands, {HeroName}.  There's this one Troll who is a lot smarter than he looks and he's gathering forces, trying to make a name for himself.  His name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color>.  I can't let that happen.  Trolls are already exceptionally strong, if they organize, we'll all be in a heap of trouble.  Think you can head over to <color deepskyblue>Four Seasons</color> and smoke him out?"
// SendOffString :
"P889788541" "Don't let that green skin and doltish expression fool you.  He's smarter than he's letting on."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4161833034" "This should be an easy one for a hero as tough as you.  Just take him out and get a few of his minions while you're at it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3424001554" "So much for abandoned.  You could hear the ruckus from this building four blocks away."

