"P1676615344" "Mario"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P942184756" "Percy"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P954531856" "Toon"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2108030959" "Grug"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2109999420" "Berg"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2929337682" "Jasper"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P3392777126" "Wesley"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P3624160969" "Ragnar"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P60487970" "Digby"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P4095903399" "Paulie"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P858796441" "So much for a scenic and peaceful.  If it's not one group of <color red>Trolls</color> trying to blow up the dam, it's another.  Well, now they have <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color>.  He's some new guy who wants to make a name for himself over in <color deepskyblue>Red River</color>.  We can't let that happen, {HeroName}.  <br><br>I need you to go in and take him out.  Right away."
// SendOffString :
"P3652021541" "Here's the deal.  I don't care if the Trolls blow themselves up.  That's fine, but when they start playing with explosives around city property, then I start to worry.  This guy actually knows a little something about explosives and that's bad."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1873166199" "You got this, {HeroName}.  Just take him out before he can do something dangerous&like teach the other Trolls how to really use explosives.  <br><br>He's in the caves doing his little 'training' sessions as we speak."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1672063376" "Caves?  Why can these guys never just do these things in the middle of the street?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DefeatVillainGroup 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

