"P128204325" "Okay, first of all, you're supposed to get away BEFORE the explosives blow.  You know, 'go boom'?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1852052896" "If I go down, {HeroName}, I'm taking you and this entire cave with me!"

