"P4013080234" "Whewww!  Good job saving the world, {HeroName}.  I'm glad you didn't get blown to bits."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1103481762" "What?  You didn't get him?  Did I mention he was training Trolls to PROPERLY use explosives?"

