// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P616992941" "Pulp"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P241099465" "Dan"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2668956612" "Troy"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2258705165" "Darrin"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P179414051" "Dalt"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P433041773" "Tiny"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P693977685" "Peach"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2203461265" "Igor"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P1423726456" "Petr"
// Boss_Name_Trolls :
"P2745300224" "Ted"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2479642395" "You know, I like <color deepskyblue>Grendel's Gulch</color> about as much as the next person.  Which is not at all.  Normally I'd let the <color red>Trolls</color> listen to some yahoo who wants to make a name for himself.  Maybe somewhere in there, they'll wipe each other out.  <br><br>But this guy...well, my contacts say he's not your usual Troll, and that makes me nervous.  His name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color> and I need you to take care of him."
// SendOffString :
"P3112829011" "You can do it, {HeroName}.  Just take him out.  While you're at it, defeat a few of his minions, too.  We need to scare them away from him."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3604924181" "He's dangerous, {HeroName}.  I'm counting on you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3825091714" "Getting to the entrance was the hard part.  Taking out these Trolls should be a piece of cake."

