"P464689129" "If you follow me, I will give you everything you've ever dreamed of.  And Superadine, too."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2984510510" "You can't stop me, {HeroName}!"

