"P1392972477" "You got him?  Great work!  Grendel's Gulch is pretty hairy, but you made it out okay.  I'm very proud of you, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P19284105" "{Boss_Name_Trolls} got the better of you?  Oh no.  This is bad news."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Hollows_GG_Mason_V_KillBoss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Boss_Name_Vahzilok 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1446251814" "As if things aren't bad enough in <color deepskyblue>Grendel's Gulch</color>.  Now that some crazy <color red>Vahzilok</color> guy by the name of <color orange>{Boss_Name_Vahzilok}</color> is trying to recruit himself an army, things just got worse.  Think you can get in there and sort this out for me, {HeroName}?"
// AcceptString :
"P1890079167" "Accept assignment to defeat {Boss_Name_Vahzilok}"
// SendOffString :
"P1700704547" "When it comes to the plans this guy has, I have two words for you, {HeroName}: 'flesh runs'.  Needless to say, the sooner you take care of him, the better - for everyone."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4019149477" "Defeat {Boss_Name_Vahzilok}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1260463594" "So far he hasn't done anything.  But it's only a matter of time before the bodies start piling up.  Take him and a few of his lackeys out before he can do any damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1995818643" "Getting to the entrance was the hard part.  Taking out these Vahzilok should be easy as pie."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - DefeatVillainGroup 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ObjectiveCount 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
