// Boss_Name_CoT :
"P3695359818" "Valdin"
// Boss_Name_CoT :
"P1393348835" "Villoric"
// Boss_Name_CoT :
"P183358641" "Xalagis"
// Boss_Name_CoT :
"P358216555" "Zenarusk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3596876981" "I don't know exactly what's going on in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Park</color>, but I'm pretty sure it's not good.  One of my sources just informed me that <color orange>{Boss_Name_CoT}</color>, a real troublemaker in the <color red>Circle of Thorns</color> is causing some trouble.  I need you to go in and take care of him."
// AcceptString :
"P1622658906" "Accept assignment to defeat {Boss_Name_CoT}"
// SendOffString :
"P1356537606" "The Circle of Thorns never seem to amaze me in their ability to cause endless trouble for us.  If they're not kidnapping our citizens, they're stealing important artifacts.  {Boss_Name_CoT} is a bad seed and he's making waves.  Big waves.  If he keeps it up, this city will have big problems."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P936503349" "Defeat {Boss_Name_CoT}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P461393610" "This shouldn't be any problem for you, {HeroName}.  Just take down {Boss_Name_CoT} and a few of his lackeys out before he can do any more damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3817036888" "The door slides closed behind you.  Time to take care of that pesky Thorn in your side."

