// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P462375629" "A <color red>Troll</color> with some brains, brawn, and political savvy is a bad bad combination, {HeroName}.  It's such a bad combination that those lunkheads are starting to listen to him over in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Park</color>.  He goes by <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color>.  So if you would get over there and take care of him, I sure would be grateful."
// SendOffString :
"P2165186845" "I don't know what it is that makes this guy so special that the other Trolls listen to him.  Maybe when you head over there you can figure it out.  See if you can get some answers out of his glassy-eyed minions, too."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3150427728" "I can't afford to have you wasting time, {HeroName}.  You really need to take care of this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P296096705" "Sewers?  Could be worse.  You could be fighting these guys in the caves."

