// IntroString :
"P368289645" ""The <color red>Vahzilok</color> are a real thorn in my side these days, {HeroName}.  One of them, in particular, is giving me a massive headache.  His name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_Vahzilok}</color>.  He's dangerous and he's been setting up camp in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Park</color>."
// SendOffString :
"P2296636428" "There is no end to the disgusting cruelty the Vahzilok will commit to justify their personal desires.  It makes me sick just thinking about it.  This new guy is even organizing their flesh runs.  You need to fix this.  And yesterday."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2842655925" "Sewage and the Vahzilok.  Not a great combination."

