"P1123601930" "Like <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Heights</color> isn't creepy enough.  One of my sources just tipped me off to a new guy within in the <color red>Circle of Thorns</color> is causing some trouble.  His name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_CoT}</color> and I need you to go in and take him down."
// SendOffString :
"P2113789354" "The Circle of Thorns are bad bad news.  If you take out their leader, maybe that'll throw them into a chaos spin for a little while."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4277758959" "Take out {Boss_Name_CoT} and snag a few of his robed minions while you're at it.  The less of them we have to deal with, the better."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P58635500" "Getting to the entrance was the hard part.  Taking out these Thorns guys should be a piece of cake."

