"P2980139547" "Hey, {HeroName}.  Some new guy named <color orange>{Boss_Name_Hellions}</color> is causing some trouble over in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Heights</color>.  It looks like he's trying to claw his way up the ranks.  I need someone who can put a stop to it."
