"P1590522313" "I hope a strong hand will help the little pyromaniacs that their illegal schoolyard antics won't be tolerated here in The Hollows."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P30675755" "This should be no problem for you, {HeroName}.  Put some fear into some of his lackeys, too.  We want to let them know he's not the guy to listen to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1808561165" "This should be no problem for a pro like you."

