// Variable - Boss_Name_Skulls 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2379270575" "You know that song lyric, 'one step forward two steps back'?  Well, that's what it feels like when I deal with the <color red>Skulls</color>.  We take down one leader, only to find another popping up someplace else.  In this case, it's in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Heights</color> and the guy's name is <color orange>{Boss_Name_Skulls}</color>.  Think you can handle it?"
// SendOffString :
"P2653664117" "This guy is a real piece of work.  He's ruthless, smart, and - worst of all - smart.  If the rest of the Skulls start listening to him, they'll manage a stronghold that will be very hard to dismantle.  We can't let that happen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P906038066" "These guys are in charge only until someone exposes their fallibility.  This is your chance to make {Boss_Name_Skulls} trip."

