// IntroString :
"P1632058640" "{HeroName}, something's going down in <color deepskyblue>Eastgate Heights</color> and I want you to take care of it.  A source tipped me off to a new guy, named <color orange>{Boss_Name_Trolls}</color>, who's causing quite a stir within the <color red>Trolls</color> gang. <br><br> I need you to go in and take him out.  Yesterday."
// SendOffString :
"P1458360133" "The only way the Trolls listen is if you speak with a very painful talking stick, so you know what to do.  Oh, and 'influence' a few of his supporters, as well."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1251858494" "Time's a-wasting, {HeroName}.  The longer you wait, the more power he gets.  That's never a good thing."

